{"productId": "678e8025-6643-4acb-9834-be0e882558c0", "modelName": "X-Bolt 2 Target Max", "modelDescription": "The new Browning X-Bolt Target MAX is a rifle that is ready to rock the range, right from the box. It includes the features you want in a precision rifle competition rifle and the adjustability to optimize how your body interacts with the rifle. The foundation of this rifle is a stiffer, heavier, full-diameter receiver that helps stabilize the rifle. Additional bolt guidance surface offers smooth cycling and bind-free performance. An alignment flat is machined into the receiver to aid in scope alignment/leveling. The recoil lug is pinned to the receiver to ensure perfect orientation if the barrel needs to be replaced. The included 20 MOA Picatinny optics rail is held in place with four oversize 8-40 screws and an additional steel pin that secures the rail to the receiver. The bolt features a longer handle to reduce the force needed to open the bolt. ", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "0439fc22-adc9-4f75-b3eb-a410066a236b", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt 2 Target Max, Bolt Action, 300 Winchester Magnum, 26\" Threaded Stainless Barrel, Muzzle Brake, Blued Finish, Black Max Composite Stock, Right Hand, 3 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/a7adc753-5f92-4408-aafc-5110473e42a5"], "isDefault": true, "manufacturerPartNumber": "036112229", "upc": "023614868705", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "524fd6af-ee59-44e5-8666-9037f52a8b0d", "valueName": "26\""}, {"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "58b272c7-0c5c-40f2-a6f8-b83b1071cc15", "valueName": "None"}, {"attributeNameId": "2765db68-a9f0-406d-8fb7-5b572b01f4ee", "attributeName": "Capacity", "attributeValueId": "20ed33da-3